# Task Management System

A full-stack **Task Management System** built with **React.js, Node.js, Express.js, and MySQL**.
The application allows users to create and manage projects, add tasks, update task status, and manage their work from a centralized dashboard.

The frontend and backend are deployed online, while the MySQL database is hosted on Railway.

---

## 🚀 Live Demo

### Frontend

https://taskmanagement-6-qabt.onrender.com/login

### Backend API

https://taskmanagement-3-hwpi.onrender.com

---

## 📌 Project Overview

Task Management System is a web-based application designed to simplify project and task management.

Users can:

* Register and login securely
* Create projects
* View all projects
* Edit projects
* Delete projects
* View project details
* Create tasks
* View tasks
* Update task status
* Delete tasks
* Manage tasks according to projects

The application uses **JWT authentication** to protect user-specific API routes.

