## ⚙️ Environment Variables

### Backend `.env`

For local development:

```env
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret

DB_HOST=HOST_NAME
DB_USER=root
DB_PASSWORD=your_mysql_password
DB_NAME=taskflow_db
DB_PORT=YOUR_PORT
```

```env
JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret

DB_HOST=your_railway_public_host
DB_USER=root
DB_PASSWORD=your_railway_mysql_password
DB_NAME=railway
DB_PORT=your_railway_public_port
```

> Never commit `.env` files or database passwords to GitHub.

---

## 🗄️ Database

The application uses **MySQL** as the relational database.

Main database entities include:

* Users
* Projects
* Tasks

Database SQL file:

```text
database/taskflow_db.sql
```

This SQL file can be used to recreate/import the database structure.

---

## 🔐 Authentication

Authentication is implemented using **JSON Web Token (JWT)**.

After successful login:

1. User sends email and password.
2. Backend validates the credentials.
3. Backend generates a JWT.
4. Token is returned to the frontend.
5. Frontend stores the token in `localStorage`.
6. Protected API requests send the token in request headers.
7. Backend middleware verifies the token.

---

## 🖥️ Run Project Locally

### 1. Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/pritu-dev/taskManagement.git
```

```bash
cd taskManagement
```

## Frontend Setup

Go to the frontend folder:

```bash
cd frontend
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
npm install
```

Start development server:

```bash
npm run dev
```

Frontend will normally run on:

```text
http://localhost:5173
```

## Backend Setup

Open another terminal and go to backend:

```bash
cd backend
```

Install dependencies:

```bash
npm install
```

Start backend:

```bash
node app.js
```

For development, if nodemon is configured:

```bash
npm run dev
```

Backend will run on:

```text
http://localhost:8080
```

---

## 🗃️ Import Database Locally

Make sure MySQL is running.

Create/select your database and import:

```bash
mysql -u root -p taskflow_db < database/taskflow_db.sql
```

## 📡 API Example

### User Login

```http
POST /api/user/login
```

Request body:

```json
{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "your_password"
}
```

### Get Projects

```http
GET /api/project/getAllProjects
```

Protected requests require the JWT token in the request headers.

Example:

```text
token: JWT_TOKEN
```

---

## 🌐 Deployment

### Frontend Deployment

Frontend is deployed using **Render**.

Build command:

```bash
npm install && npm run build
```

Start command:

```bash
npm run preview -- --host 0.0.0.0
```

Root directory:

```text
frontend
```

### Backend Deployment

Backend is deployed using **Render**.

Build command:

```bash
npm install
```

Start command:

```bash
node app.js
```

Backend URL:

```text
https://taskmanagement-3-hwpi.onrender.com
```

---

### Database Deployment

MySQL is deployed using **Railway**.

The local SQL database was exported using:

```text
taskflow_db.sql
```

and imported into the Railway MySQL database.

